        <span><i class="fa-solid fa-feather mr-2"></i> Cartographer's Logbook — Active API Mode</span>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span>API Status: <strong id="apiStatusText" class="text-amber-400">Connected</strong></span>
            <button onclick="openApiModal()" class="bg-[#4a3525] hover:bg-[#5c4331] text-[#f4ecd8] px-2.5 py-1 rounded text-[11px] border border-[#d3c2a5]/40 font-bold">Configure API Key</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="apiModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="bg-[#f4ecd8] border-2 border-[#2c221e] rounded-xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4">
            <h3 class="heading-font text-xl text-[#2c221e]"><i class="fa-solid fa-key mr-2"></i> External API Key Setup</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#5c4331]">Paste your external travel/mapping API key below for your screen recording session. It remains securely in your browser session.</p>
